algorithms.pseudocode:
function PadicTargetError(p, k):
  // Input: prime p, precision level k >= 0
  // Output: target error epsilon = p^{-k/2}
  threshold = p^k
  epsilon = 1 / sqrt(threshold)
  return epsilon

Property: epsilon^2 = 1/p^k
Property: p^k * epsilon^2 = 1

function CheckCompatible(profile, p, k):
  // Input: complexity profile, prime p, level k
  // Output: (epsilon, compatible?)
  threshold = p^k
  eps_sq = 1/p^k
  budget = profile.sampleSize * eps_sq
  rate = profile.quotientComplexity + profile.codeLength + profile.posteriorKL
  sample_ok = (threshold <= profile.sampleSize)
  rate_ok = (rate <= budget)
  return (1/sqrt(p^k), sample_ok AND rate_ok)

Correctness: If compatible, then GeneralizesAtPrecision(profile, epsilon)
